  <div class="about-grid"><h2>Engineering for the<br /><em>real world.</em></h2><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m a senior engineer focused on scalable backend systems and practical AI. Over four years in cybersecurity SaaS, I’ve built platforms that serve hundreds of enterprise tenants and process millions of security records.</p><p>My work sits at the intersection of <a href="#expertise">distributed infrastructure</a>, <a href="#expertise">safe automation</a>, and products people can actually use—from vulnerability remediation agents to a privacy-first suite of 31 browser tools.</p></div></div>
